sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as ProductDetailPage
  participant API as productApi
  participant C as productController
  participant M as Product Model
  participant Cart as Redux cartSlice
  UI->>API: getProduct(id)
  API->>C: GET /api/products/:id
  C->>M: findByPk + increment views
  M-->>UI: product DTO
  UI->>Cart: addToCart(product, quantity)
  Cart->>Cart: merge and clamp by stock
  Cart-->>UI: updated cart items
